  "description": "The first New Years Furry Ball (\"NYFB\") began in 2005 as a small gathering known as \"Room Con.\" Over the years, it expanded into one of the Northeast’s longest-running furry New Year celebrations, welcoming hundreds of attendees annually.\r\n\r\nToday, NYFB is a multi-day 18+ event that brings together members of the furry fandom from a wide range of backgrounds and interests to celebrate the start of a new year in a fun, social, and community-focused environment.",
